Package: r8169-mainline-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 3.0.0), make, gcc, linux-headers-amd64 | proxmox-default-headers
Recommends: firmware-realtek
Description: DKMS package for mainline Realtek r8169 (backported)
 This package builds and installs the r8169 driver from a specified
 Linux mainline tag/commit via DKMS, overriding the in-kernel r8169.
 Useful to test recent fixes (e.g., ASPM-related changes) on older kernels.
